    "Apple TV can only act as a Remote Display. It requires the full Smart Scoreboard app on macOS or iPad to pair, control, and run the scoreboard." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the limitations of Apple TVs as remote displays.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
