            "value" : "Apple TV 只能作为远程显示使用。它需要 macOS 或 iPad 上的完整 Smart Scoreboard 应用进行配对、控制并运行记分牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple TV can only act as a Remote Display. Use the full Smart Scoreboard app on macOS or iPad to pair this Apple TV, control the scoreboard, and send live updates." : {
