    "If you close Scoreboard or switch to another app, iPadOS may pause local web connections even if you did not force quit. Keep Scoreboard open during production use. When you return to the app, the Web API restarts automatically if it is still enabled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果关闭 Scoreboard 或切换到其他 App，即使没有强制退出，iPadOS 也可能暂停本地网页连接。制作现场请保持 Scoreboard 打开。返回 App 后，如果 Web API 仍处于启用状态，它会自动重新启动。"
