        }
      }
    },
    "Third-Party Licenses" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第三方许可证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This API publishes scoreboard state to the trusted local network only. Connected devices can read live game data, but the service rejects score, clock, roster, file, and settings changes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 API 只向可信的本地网络发布记分牌状态。已连接设备可以读取实时比赛数据，但服务会拒绝比分、计时、名单、文件和设置更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app does not collect any data and does not phone any third-party server." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the app's privacy policy.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本应用不会收集任何数据，也不会连接任何第三方服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Device" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device is a Remote Display. On the tablet or computer running Smart Scoreboard, go to Settings > Integration > Remote Display, then enter the code below." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to connect a remote display to a tablet or computer.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设备是远程显示。请在运行 Smart Scoreboard 的平板电脑或电脑上前往“设置”>“集成”>“远程显示”，然后输入下方代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device is a Remote Display. Open Smart Scoreboard on a tablet or computer, enable Remote Display Pairing, then enter the code below from that operator device." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to connect a remote display to a smart scoreboard.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设备是远程显示。请在平板电脑或电脑上打开 Smart Scoreboard，启用远程显示配对，然后从该操作设备输入下方代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This placeholder reserves the integration section while event triggers, command mapping, and connection settings are designed. It can run alongside Web API when implemented." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此占位内容会保留集成区域，事件触发器、命令映射和连接设置将在后续设计。实现后，它可以与 Web API 同时运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Remote Display will remove all saved operator devices. Each master will need to pair again with a 4-digit code." : {
      "comment" : "A message displayed in a confirmation dialog.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此远程显示将移除所有已保存的操作设备。每台主控设备都需要使用 4 位代码重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Remote Display will remove all saved operator devices. Each operator device will need to pair again with a 4-digit code." : {
      "comment" : "A message displayed in a confirmation dialog.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此远程显示将移除所有已保存的操作设备。每台操作设备都需要使用 4 位代码重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This screen mirrors the Remote Display output. On the main Smart Scoreboard window, go to Settings > Integration > Remote Display to pair." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此屏幕会镜像远程显示输出。请在 Smart Scoreboard 主窗口中前往“设置”>“集成”>“远程显示”进行配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This screen mirrors the Remote Display output. Use the main Smart Scoreboard window on this device to pair." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
