            "value" : "本软件是根据 GNU 通用公共许可证第 3 版发布的自由软件。你可以依据这些条款重新分发和修改本软件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will delete all local game files, log sessions, roster edits, settings, integrations, and current game state." : {
      "comment" : "A message displayed in an alert when the user is about to factory reset the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
